            "notes": "[Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4) is a good pick, since it will make us tankier with [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e). [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e) counts sleeps even before you obtain the power. [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4)is also strong for defending yourself and being offensive if the enemy has no dive.\n\nIf the enemy has no dive [Cluster Core](item_c63cd7ba-b71c-4503-bdb6-4ef0b0a4bdbb) is another option.",
